3.11 Mortality Record
During the project, nine birds died.
Table 3.2 Mortality Summary
Description	Number
Initial stock	60
Mortality	9
Birds remaining	51
Possible Causes
•	Stress during brooding.
•	Disease.
•	Pecking.
•	Weak chicks.
•	Environmental stress.
Corrective measures included improving brooding management, strengthening biosecurity, and providing vitamin supplements.
